{
    "title": "Yama: Manga Collector",
    "description": "Manga collectors rejoice!\r\nYama is a FREE, no ads, clean and easy way to catalog your collection!\r\n- Scan your manga's ISBN and add it to your collection\r\n- Check out your collection in your Yama library\r\n- View strangers or friends' libraries and compare\r\n- An ever-growing library of manga\r\n- Friends! Follow your IRL or online friends; compare collections or check out what they've been reading or collecting\r\n- Wishlist! Keep track of the volumes and series that you want to buy or read later\r\n\r\nAnd some features currently in development\r\n- Badges! Collect badges while collecting your favorite manga\r\n- Reviews! Review your favorite volumes, or check out reviews for a series you've been keeping an eye on\r\n- Many more! You can contact us if you can come up with an awesome feature\r\n\r\nDisclamer\r\nYama currently only works great with english spoken volumes. Other languages or regions may not have the same experience. We'll do our best to support other languages but that may require additional development.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Manga collectors rejoice!<br>Yama is a FREE, no ads, clean and easy way to catalog your collection!<br>- Scan your manga&#39;s ISBN and add it to your collection<br>- Check out your collection in your Yama library<br>- View strangers or friends&#39; libraries and compare<br>- An ever-growing library of manga<br>- Friends! Follow your IRL or online friends; compare collections or check out what they&#39;ve been reading or collecting<br>- Wishlist! Keep track of the volumes and series that you want to buy or read later<br><br>And some features currently in development<br>- Badges! Collect badges while collecting your favorite manga<br>- Reviews! Review your favorite volumes, or check out reviews for a series you&#39;ve been keeping an eye on<br>- Many more! You can contact us if you can come up with an awesome feature<br><br>Disclamer<br>Yama currently only works great with english spoken volumes. Other languages or regions may not have the same experience. We&#39;ll do our best to support other languages but that may require additional development.",
